# Increment C-a — original saved authority trace

Status: completed, read-only. This trace found an authenticated per-round executor authority that is independent of each reservation: `CampaignRoundLaunchV5.adapter_config_ref`. Both saved round configs authenticate and their executor digests match all ten real runtime-04 reservations. The original process-environment preimage was not saved, so the historical executor composite cannot be reproduced from launch metadata alone. No correction was implemented.

## Scope and method

The traced repository is:

`C:/Projects/trading_bot/RS-momentum-EMA-trading-bot/.worktrees/pit-optimizer-v5-architecture/.artifacts/pit-optimizer-v5/development/runtime-04`

The only campaign inspected was `development-controller-two-rounds-20260907-04`. No summary, campaign, evaluation, reconciliation, cleanup, Docker command, external call, test, credential or environment-value read occurred. State reads used `repair=False`; old artifacts were unchanged. The inspected typed paths are read-only at `artifacts.py:1914-1974,2571-2599`; manifest graph authentication is at `manifest.py:699-744`.

